{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/37"}}
{"text":"וַיֹּ֥אמֶר "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהוָ֖ה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" אֶל־מֹשֶׁ֥ה לֵּאמֹֽר:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/shema/numbers_15/chapter/38","n":"38"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/38"}}
{"text":"דַּבֵּ֞ר אֶל־בְּנֵ֤י יִשְׂרָאֵל֙ וְאָֽמַרְתָּ֣ אֲלֵהֶ֔ם וְעָשׂ֨וּ לָהֶ֥ם צִיצִ֛ת עַל־כַּנְפֵ֥י בִגְדֵיהֶ֖ם לְדֹרֹתָ֑ם וְנָ֥תְנוּ עַל־צִיצִ֥ת הַכָּנָ֖ף פְּתִ֥יל תְּכֵֽלֶת:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/shema/numbers_15/chapter/39","n":"39"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/39"}}
{"text":"וְהָיָ֣ה לָכֶם֮ לְצִיצִת֒ וּרְאִיתֶ֣ם אֹת֗וֹ וּזְכַרְתֶּם֙ אֶת־כָּל־מִצְוֹ֣ת "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהוָ֔ה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" וַעֲשִׂיתֶ֖ם אֹתָ֑ם וְלֹא תָת֜וּרוּ אַחֲרֵ֤י לְבַבְכֶם֙ וְאַחֲרֵ֣י עֵינֵיכֶ֔ם אֲשֶׁר־אַתֶּ֥ם זֹנִ֖ים אַחֲרֵיהֶֽם:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/shema/numbers_15/chapter/40","n":"40"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/40"}}
{"text":"לְמַ֣עַן תִּזְכְּר֔וּ וַעֲשִׂיתֶ֖ם אֶת־כָּל־מִצְוֹתָ֑י וִהְיִיתֶ֥ם קְדֹשִׁ֖ים לֵאלֹֽהֵיכֶֽם:"}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/shema/numbers_15/chapter/41","n":"41"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/15/41"}}
{"text":"אֲנִ֞י "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהוָ֣ה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" אֱלֹֽהֵיכֶ֗ם אֲשֶׁ֨ר הוֹצֵ֤אתִי אֶתְכֶם֙ מֵאֶ֣רֶץ מִצְרַ֔יִם לִהְי֥וֹת לָכֶ֖ם לֵאלֹהִ֑ים אֲנִ֖י "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהוָ֥ה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
